I was thinking today about character stats in nethack, and thought
it would be cool if there were monsters that, like level drain or
strength drain, attacked different stats [but unlike the mind flayer weren't
so tough].

How about monsters that:
	- attack your stomach (make you hungry)
	- attack your charisma ("you feel ugly. more...")
	- other characteristics.

Then
	1) It wouldn't be quite so easy to get stats up to 18.
	2) If you couldn't genocide them, it would be yet another [feature?]
		that makes life tough for high level characters.
	
	or else you could get stat-protecting intrinsics.

What do you think?

